  "details": "# Issue:\nThe Calibration Mirror is not just showing your self, but also remote players.\n**Steps to reproduce: (VR + FBT only)**\n1. Go to a world with other users.\n2. Go to a position where other users are behind you.\n3. Turn on the Calibration Mirror.\n4. Press Calibrate in your QM.\nIf you do this you will be able to see remote players in your Calibration Mirror.\n# Suggestion:\nThe Calibration Mirror should only show your self and not others. It showing remote players can be really disorientating.\n# Attachments:\nIn the picture below you can see the issue:",
